  <h2>Why it matters for plant work</h2>
  <p>
    Process data behaves the same way: readings depend on what came before, and a model that only knows its training range can miss exactly the excursion that matters. My conclusion was a hybrid: a transparent ARIMA-type model for routine control, with a neural network watching for conditions outside the normal range.
  </p>
